WEBVTT

00:06:29.579 --> 00:06:34.996
on this idea of for those of us who are so
accustomed to to treating excellence

00:06:34.996 --> 00:06:38.454
or expertises as our armor,
how do we let go of that?

00:06:38.996 --> 00:06:43.788
Well, first of all, I have to say that
your story of when you are 12 is real

00:06:43.788 --> 00:06:46.663
trauma. I mean, that's really
that that's trauma.

00:06:46.663 --> 00:06:50.038
And yes, there are different kinds of
trauma and different sizes of the bucket.

00:06:50.038 --> 00:06:54.746
But when you're 12, it's
all about belonging.

00:06:54.746 --> 00:06:56.913
And I think I have the same story.

00:06:56.913 --> 00:07:00.329
I was I was 13, not 12, but I
have a very similar story.